s, tree-jumping chaos, and primal mayhem. But something\u2019s off this time. The game doesn\u2019t end. The NPCs start acting... aware. And that ancient monke temple deep in the jungle? It\u2019s calling your name. Are you just playing the game\u2014or is the game playing you?\n\n", "short_description": "play it its fun and you can a MONKE"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-bonke/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "offsale", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/monke-bonke/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9879396372148384"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820648_1415578836282032_7152939137888333382_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BdEmSGd_Ji8Q7kNvwE36SGi&_nc_oc=AdqAmGQM-sjUR6udrKR-ShTBl2Dka826iYMvgRyub0K4-7_Q0cXcNKY1c22wH1UQ5Dk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af618JFldxr7wvwDiajb0QpS-n20U6AJqUNsoNhpSOQ2KQ&oe=6A01DEB4"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Monk Bonk", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "274